{"real": true, "dur": 114.48, "sent": [{"start": 0.2, "end": 3.74, "text": "Each linguistic goal gets its own lesson page.", "words": [{"w": "Each", "s": 0.2}, {"w": "linguistic", "s": 0.46}, {"w": "goal", "s": 1.14}, {"w": "gets", "s": 1.88}, {"w": "its", "s": 2.14}, {"w": "own", "s": 2.48}, {"w": "lesson", "s": 2.92}, {"w": "page.", "s": 3.34}]}, {"start": 4.64, "end": 15.24, "text": "Communicative goals, on the other hand, get something different: four activities, one each for listening, reading, speaking and writing.", "words": [{"w": "Communicative", "s": 4.64}, {"w": "goals,", "s": 5.46}, {"w": "on", "s": 6.2}, {"w": "the", "s": 6.34}, {"w": "other", "s": 6.5}, {"w": "hand,", "s": 6.74}, {"w": "get", "s": 7.4}, {"w": "something", "s": 7.6}, {"w": "different:", "s": 8.0}, {"w": "four", "s": 9.36}, {"w": "activities,", "s": 9.7}, {"w": "one", "s": 10.8}, {"w": "each", "s": 11.12}, {"w": "for", "s": 11.9}, {"w": "listening,", "s": 12.12}, {"w": "reading,", "s": 13.02}, {"w": "speaking", "s": 13.86}, {"w": "and", "s": 14.58}, {"w": "writing.", "s": 14.76}]}, {"start": 15.72, "end": 17.66, "text": "I’ll show you those shortly.", "words": [{"w": "I’ll", "s": 15.72}, {"w": "show", "s": 15.98}, {"w": "you", "s": 16.219}, {"w": "those", "s": 16.46}, {"w": "shortly.", "s": 17.18}]}, {"start": 18.56, "end": 25.78, "text": "Sometimes, though, one stop brings in more than one concept, in the same lesson.", "words": [{"w": "Sometimes,", "s": 18.56}, {"w": "though,", "s": 19.7}, {"w": "one", "s": 20.78}, {"w": "stop", "s": 21.18}, {"w": "brings", "s": 21.84}, {"w": "in", "s": 22.28}, {"w": "more", "s": 22.58}, {"w": "than", "s": 22.9}, {"w": "one", "s": 23.24}, {"w": "concept,", "s": 23.68}, {"w": "in", "s": 24.8}, {"w": "the", "s": 24.9}, {"w": "same", "s": 25.08}, {"w": "lesson.", "s": 25.36}]}, {"start": 26.24, "end": 36.1, "text": "In Unit 0, for example, the days of the week come together with the moments of the day: morning and evening, for instance.", "words": [{"w": "In", "s": 26.24}, {"w": "Unit", "s": 26.42}, {"w": "0,", "s": 27.1}, {"w": "for", "s": 27.6}, {"w": "example,", "s": 27.76}, {"w": "the", "s": 29.1}, {"w": "days", "s": 29.28}, {"w": "of", "s": 29.66}, {"w": "the", "s": 29.8}, {"w": "week", "s": 29.96}, {"w": "come", "s": 30.28}, {"w": "together", "s": 30.62}, {"w": "with", "s": 31.42}, {"w": "the", "s": 31.6}, {"w": "moments", "s": 31.76}, {"w": "of", "s": 32.299}, {"w": "the", "s": 32.439}, {"w": "day:", "s": 32.58}, {"w": "morning", "s": 33.9}, {"w": "and", "s": 34.66}, {"w": "evening,", "s": 34.9}, {"w": "for", "s": 35.4}, {"w": "instance.", "s": 35.56}]}, {"start": 36.66, "end": 45.76, "text": "That’s because beginners need both from the very first lesson, and because they overlap: you say “Monday morning” in one breath.", "words": [{"w": "That’s", "s": 36.66}, {"w": "because", "s": 36.94}, {"w": "beginners", "s": 37.78}, {"w": "need", "s": 38.48}, {"w": "both", "s": 38.8}, {"w": "from", "s": 39.14}, {"w": "the", "s": 39.36}, {"w": "very", "s": 39.54}, {"w": "first", "s": 39.86}, {"w": "lesson,", "s": 40.16}, {"w": "and", "s": 41.08}, {"w": "because", "s": 41.26}, {"w": "they", "s": 41.8}, {"w": "overlap:", "s": 42.08}, {"w": "you", "s": 43.48}, {"w": "say", "s": 43.68}, {"w": "“Monday", "s": 43.88}, {"w": "morning”", "s": 44.64}, {"w": "in", "s": 45.08}, {"w": "one", "s": 45.24}, {"w": "breath.", "s": 45.48}]}, {"start": 46.32, "end": 47.88, "text": "Each page has six tabs.", "words": [{"w": "Each", "s": 46.32}, {"w": "page", "s": 46.62}, {"w": "has", "s": 46.98}, {"w": "six", "s": 47.2}, {"w": "tabs.", "s": 47.5}]}, {"start": 48.38, "end": 58.98, "text": "Learners start with the course path, then move through explanations, forms and exercises, with bonus material and a word list at the end.", "words": [{"w": "Learners", "s": 48.38}, {"w": "start", "s": 48.76}, {"w": "with", "s": 49.18}, {"w": "the", "s": 49.36}, {"w": "course", "s": 49.52}, {"w": "path,", "s": 49.88}, {"w": "then", "s": 50.76}, {"w": "move", "s": 51.02}, {"w": "through", "s": 51.44}, {"w": "explanations,", "s": 51.94}, {"w": "forms", "s": 53.36}, {"w": "and", "s": 54.0}, {"w": "exercises,", "s": 54.24}, {"w": "with", "s": 55.56}, {"w": "bonus", "s": 55.86}, {"w": "material", "s": 56.26}, {"w": "and", "s": 57.44}, {"w": "a", "s": 57.6}, {"w": "word", "s": 57.74}, {"w": "list", "s": 58.04}, {"w": "at", "s": 58.38}, {"w": "the", "s": 58.54}, {"w": "end.", "s": 58.74}]}, {"start": 59.78, "end": 62.84, "text": "Let’s look more closely at one of those tabs.", "words": [{"w": "Let’s", "s": 59.78}, {"w": "look", "s": 60.04}, {"w": "more", "s": 60.3}, {"w": "closely", "s": 60.62}, {"w": "at", "s": 61.3}, {"w": "one", "s": 61.56}, {"w": "of", "s": 61.9}, {"w": "those", "s": 62.08}, {"w": "tabs.", "s": 62.4}]}, {"start": 63.34, "end": 67.52, "text": "Here is the exercise tab of another page, for “to like”.", "words": [{"w": "Here", "s": 63.34}, {"w": "is", "s": 63.68}, {"w": "the", "s": 63.86}, {"w": "exercise", "s": 64.04}, {"w": "tab", "s": 64.64}, {"w": "of", "s": 65.12}, {"w": "another", "s": 65.34}, {"w": "page,", "s": 65.76}, {"w": "for", "s": 66.76}, {"w": "“to", "s": 66.92}, {"w": "like”.", "s": 67.24}]}, {"start": 68.52, "end": 72.3, "text": "It is a single sentence generator with three levels.", "words": [{"w": "It", "s": 68.52}, {"w": "is", "s": 68.66}, {"w": "a", "s": 68.92}, {"w": "single", "s": 69.12}, {"w": "sentence", "s": 69.58}, {"w": "generator", "s": 70.22}, {"w": "with", "s": 71.04}, {"w": "three", "s": 71.4}, {"w": "levels.", "s": 71.8}]}, {"start": 73.12, "end": 79.68, "text": "Each sentence starts from pictures: for example, “we”, a broken heart and a piano.", "words": [{"w": "Each", "s": 73.12}, {"w": "sentence", "s": 73.48}, {"w": "starts", "s": 74.08}, {"w": "from", "s": 74.48}, {"w": "pictures:", "s": 74.8}, {"w": "for", "s": 75.78}, {"w": "example,", "s": 75.92}, {"w": "“we”,", "s": 76.42}, {"w": "a", "s": 77.76}, {"w": "broken", "s": 77.86}, {"w": "heart", "s": 78.28}, {"w": "and", "s": 78.94}, {"w": "a", "s": 79.06}, {"w": "piano.", "s": 79.18}]}, {"start": 80.06, "end": 87.06, "text": "At one star, the verb is given, and you pick its right form from a list of all its forms.", "words": [{"w": "At", "s": 80.06}, {"w": "one", "s": 80.28}, {"w": "star,", "s": 80.56}, {"w": "the", "s": 81.36}, {"w": "verb", "s": 81.54}, {"w": "is", "s": 81.84}, {"w": "given,", "s": 82.04}, {"w": "and", "s": 82.9}, {"w": "you", "s": 83.06}, {"w": "pick", "s": 83.26}, {"w": "its", "s": 83.74}, {"w": "right", "s": 84.0}, {"w": "form", "s": 84.28}, {"w": "from", "s": 85.08}, {"w": "a", "s": 85.32}, {"w": "list", "s": 85.42}, {"w": "of", "s": 85.88}, {"w": "all", "s": 86.16}, {"w": "its", "s": 86.4}, {"w": "forms.", "s": 86.64}]}, {"start": 88.02, "end": 93.16, "text": "Then, at two stars, you pick the verb and the article together.", "words": [{"w": "Then,", "s": 88.02}, {"w": "at", "s": 88.86}, {"w": "two", "s": 89.08}, {"w": "stars,", "s": 89.3}, {"w": "you", "s": 90.34}, {"w": "pick", "s": 90.52}, {"w": "the", "s": 90.8}, {"w": "verb", "s": 91.0}, {"w": "and", "s": 91.7}, {"w": "the", "s": 91.84}, {"w": "article", "s": 92.04}, {"w": "together.", "s": 92.64}]}, {"start": 93.56, "end": 97.9, "text": "Finally, at three stars, you type the whole sentence yourself.", "words": [{"w": "Finally,", "s": 93.56}, {"w": "at", "s": 94.58}, {"w": "three", "s": 95.04}, {"w": "stars,", "s": 95.32}, {"w": "you", "s": 96.02}, {"w": "type", "s": 96.2}, {"w": "the", "s": 96.46}, {"w": "whole", "s": 96.6}, {"w": "sentence", "s": 96.86}, {"w": "yourself.", "s": 97.32}]}, {"start": 98.66, "end": 104.54, "text": "And after that, the Bonus gives you the English and asks for the French, with no help at all.", "words": [{"w": "And", "s": 98.66}, {"w": "after", "s": 98.9}, {"w": "that,", "s": 99.2}, {"w": "the", "s": 99.88}, {"w": "Bonus", "s": 100.04}, {"w": "gives", "s": 100.5}, {"w": "you", "s": 100.74}, {"w": "the", "s": 100.9}, {"w": "English", "s": 101.08}, {"w": "and", "s": 101.9}, {"w": "asks", "s": 102.1}, {"w": "for", "s": 102.4}, {"w": "the", "s": 102.54}, {"w": "French,", "s": 102.72}, {"w": "with", "s": 103.3}, {"w": "no", "s": 103.56}, {"w": "help", "s": 103.78}, {"w": "at", "s": 104.06}, {"w": "all.", "s": 104.32}]}, {"start": 104.96, "end": 108.98, "text": "So what I learned here: one exercise, three levels.", "words": [{"w": "So", "s": 104.96}, {"w": "what", "s": 105.14}, {"w": "I", "s": 105.36}, {"w": "learned", "s": 105.48}, {"w": "here:", "s": 105.72}, {"w": "one", "s": 106.64}, {"w": "exercise,", "s": 106.86}, {"w": "three", "s": 108.24}, {"w": "levels.", "s": 108.46}]}, {"start": 109.72, "end": 112.6, "text": "Keep it on one page, with one generator.", "words": [{"w": "Keep", "s": 109.72}, {"w": "it", "s": 109.88}, {"w": "on", "s": 110.02}, {"w": "one", "s": 110.22}, {"w": "page,", "s": 110.44}, {"w": "with", "s": 111.52}, {"w": "one", "s": 111.76}, {"w": "generator.", "s": 111.94}]}, {"start": 113.36, "end": 113.76, "text": "That’s it.", "words": [{"w": "That’s", "s": 113.36}, {"w": "it.", "s": 113.6}]}]}